One of my complaints with advfs is the almost complete lack of documentation
with respect to performance and tuning.

There is an undocumented utility to produce advfs statistics:

	usage: advfsstat [options] [stats-type] domain

	usage: advfsstat [options] -f 0 | 1 | 2 domain fileset

	options:
	        -i sec          repeat display every 'sec' seconds
	        -c count        repeat display 'count' times
	        -R              display ratios (use with -b, -p, -r)

	stats-type:
	        -b              buffer cache statistics
	        -f 0            all fileset vnop statistics
