Its pretty easy to build (at least under Digital Unix 3.2).

I just ftp'd the source (from ftp.x.org in the /contrib directory)
then typed xmkmf to build a Makefile.  It wants to be built with gcc &
imake inserts cc specific flags.  To avoid this, either change the
Imakefile to use cc, or build it with make -e 'CC=cc'  (Or strip the
cc specific flags from the Makefile & use gcc).

