>In article <saunders-1304952006550001@caspar.che.wisc.edu>, saunders@castor.che.wisc.edu (Brian Saunders) writes:
>> Lately, we've had a few errors like the one below show up on our machine:
>> 
>> Apr  5 18:12:03 pollux vmunix: trap: invalid memory read access from kernel mode
>> Apr  5 18:12:04 pollux vmunix: panic (cpu 0): kernel memory fault
