I poked around a little more and found:
The changed major and minor device number appears to be related in some way
to how the machine sets its clock speed (tick and tickadj)? I found the
following lines in the daemon.log file (not necessarily std filename).  The 
/var/adm/messages file did NOT have these messages.

Apr  6 17:07:42 cwts3 mountd[186]: startup
