: >hi all,	
: >	We have 2 DEC 2100 servers running DEC OSF/1 3.0.
: >Both have 64MB RAM and 128MB swap allocated. However even 
: >with a low user load, after sometime the machines run
: >out of swap and then totally hang. A reboot seems to be the
: >only escape out. This is even if the user application is
: > not memory intensive.
