Hi - to do this you need to move a couple of writable files
from /usr/lib/X11 into /var, leaving symlinks behind. You
have to add the mount command to the end of bcheckrc.

We had a prototype running like this for a while. The /usr
was not only NFS mounted, the machine exporting it was
exporting it from CDROM.

